{"root":"remuk","ipa":"/rəˈmʊk/","core":"形容物体被彻底粉碎、破碎或毁坏的状态，常指因外力作用而变得支离破碎。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/rəˈmʊk/","zh":"粉碎的，破碎的","phrases":[{"t":"remuk redam","zh":"粉身碎骨，彻底破碎"},{"t":"hati remuk","zh":"心碎"},{"t":"remuk berkeping-keping","zh":"碎成碎片"}],"examples":[{"t":"Gelas itu jatuh ke lantai dan remuk.","zh":"杯子掉在地上摔碎了。"},{"t":"Hatinya remuk mendengar kabar duka itu.","zh":"听到那个噩耗，她心碎了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"remuk","ipa":"/rəˈmʊk/","zh":"粉碎的","phrase":{"t":"remuk redam","zh":"彻底粉碎"},"example":{"t":"Mobil itu remuk setelah kecelakaan.","zh":"车子在事故后彻底报废了。"}},{"w":"meremukkan","ipa":"/mərəˈmʊkkan/","zh":"使粉碎，压碎","phrase":{"t":"meremukkan tulang","zh":"压碎骨头"},"example":{"t":"Dia meremukkan kertas itu menjadi bola.","zh":"他把纸揉成一团。"}},{"w":"teremuk","ipa":"/tərəˈmʊk/","zh":"被压碎的，不小心被弄碎的","phrase":{"t":"teremuk hatinya","zh":"被伤透了心"},"example":{"t":"Kue itu teremuk di dalam tas.","zh":"饼干在包里被压碎了。"}},{"w":"keremukan","ipa":"/kərəˈmʊkan/","zh":"破碎状态，碎屑","phrase":{"t":"keremukan biskuit","zh":"饼干碎屑"},"example":{"t":"Ada banyak keremukan di atas meja.","zh":"桌子上有很多碎屑。"}}],"derSlugs":["remuk","meremukkan","teremuk","keremukan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:44:19.576Z","src":"base"}